        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Bravely Second: The Ballad of the Three Cavaliers is a pre-launch prelude to the Bravely Second: End Layer and released as a demo in the eShop. In contrast to the full game, the demo features a unique storyline and simplified versions of some gameplay elements. The prelude focuses on the Three Cavaliers – Yew Geneolgia, Janne Angard, and Nikolai Nikolanikov.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Bravely Second: The Ballad of the Three Cavaliers es un preludio previo al lanzamiento de Bravely Second: End Layer, publicado como demo en la eShop. A diferencia del juego completo, la demo presenta una historia única y versiones simplificadas de algunos elementos de jugabilidad. El preludio se centra en los Tres Caballeros: Yew Geneolgia, Janne Angard y Nikolai Nikolanikov.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
