        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "A new world, a new story, and all-new Heroes of Light await in an original RPG experience arriving on the Nintendo Switch system in 2020! This successor to the original Bravely Default game comes from the team that brought you the Bravely series and Octopath Traveler, and features music from Revo (Sound Horizon/Linked Horizon), acclaimed composer of the Bravely Default soundtrack.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "¡Un nuevo mundo, una nueva historia y héroes de la luz completamente nuevos aguardan en una experiencia de RPG original que llegará a la consola Nintendo Switch en 2020! Esta sucesora del juego original Bravely Default proviene del equipo que creó la serie Bravely y Octopath Traveler, y cuenta con música de Revo (Sound Horizon/Linked Horizon), compositor aclamado de la banda sonora de Bravely Default.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
